    "body": "Is the proposal here, in terms of observable semantics, that e.g.\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<style>\r\ninput:lang(en) { border: red; }\r\ninput:lang(jp) { border: blue; }\r\n<input>\r\n```\r\n\r\nwould start with a red border, but have a blue border once the user starts typing with a Japanese IME?",
