    "body": "Although I'm not sure what the opt-in would look like, should we also have it for `<input dir>` as well? \r\n\r\nI'd not mind if both these cases resolved to `auto` by default, but I can also understand the risk of potential commotion when browsers get it wrong. ^^\r\n\r\nEdit: I just now realized you are proposing `lang=auto` as the opt-in, which already is the case for `dir=auto`. I thought you were proposing something that might be of more convenience than an HTML attribute, is _that_ an option?",
